- Update to version 1.5:
  * Add --no-align option to skip the alignment step completely
  * Add --no-transform option to skip image transform alignment
  * Add --align-keep-size option to keep original image size
  * Reduce blur in findTransformECC alignment
  * Fix integer rounding in Task_Merge denoising
  * Fix build warnings and update OpenCV include paths
  * Add CMakeLists.txt build support
- Rebase fix-version.patch for the updated version string
- Spec file cleanup via spec-cleaner

